cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the tahini dataset, please cite both the article and this repository."
title: "kanfood: Kolmogorov–Arnold networks as closed-form calibrations for food spectroscopy"
abstract: >-
  Code, results and the open tahini ATR-FTIR adulteration dataset for a leakage-free comparison of a
  Kolmogorov-Arnold network with PLS, SVR, random forest, MLP and 1-D CNN calibrations (tahini by ATR-FTIR,
  mango dry matter by NIR), including the extraction of closed-form calibration equations.
